description:
Keep the list of who you are waiting for on your board, so others (and the user's overview page) can see it. Add a line when you send a request and stop to wait; remove it with done = true when the answer comes. who = a proc name or "user". At most 20 lines. Examples:
- {"who": "ok-view", "what": "schema review"}
- {"who": "user", "what": "decide the six board questions"}
- {"who": "ok-view", "done": true}
Returns the board written (or says nothing was removed). Errors: ArgumentsBad, BoardFull, WriteFailed, StackMissing.
